  "body": "Now that [MSC3173](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/pull/3173) has merged we've updated [MSC2946](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/pull/2946) to mention that join rules, not history visibility, should be used when returning results in the spaces summary.\r\n\r\nWe need to update the spaces summary to include any rooms that are *joinable* as opposed to those with world readable history visibility.",
